{"id":270,"title":"旋转数组二分查找","summary":"在旋转数组二分查找某个数字，难度：中等。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089a24439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 问题\n\n假设一个升序数组被**旋转了**。例如，数组`nums = [0,1,2,4,5,6,7]`可能变成：\n\n- `[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]`，被旋转`4`次。\n\n- `[0,1,2,4,5,6,7]`，被旋转了`7`次。\n\n注意: 一个数组`[nums[0], nums[1], nums[2], ..., nums[n-1]]` 1次的旋转结果是`[nums[n-1], nums[0], nums[1], nums[2], ..., nums[n-2]`。\n\n\n输入一个旋转数组`nums`和目标值`target`。如果`target`在数组中存在，则返回索引。否则，返回`-1`。\n\n**限制条件：**\n\n- $1 \\leq nums.length \\leq 5000$\n- $-5000 \\leq nums[i] \\leq 5000$\n- `nums`的所有整数都是**唯一的**\n- `nums`被排序和旋转\n- $-10^4 \\leq target \\leq 10^4$\n\n**例子1：**\n\n```\nInput: [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], 0    \nOutput: 4\n```\n\n**例子2：**\n\n```\nInput: [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], 3    \nOutput: -1\n```\n\n**例子3：**\n\n```\nInput: [1], 0    \nOutput: -1\n```","text_html":"<h2>问题</h2>\n<p>假设一个升序数组被<strong>旋转了</strong>。例如，数组<code>nums = [0,1,2,4,5,6,7]</code>可能变成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]</code>，被旋转<code>4</code>次。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>[0,1,2,4,5,6,7]</code>，被旋转了<code>7</code>次。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意: 一个数组<code>[nums[0], nums[1], nums[2], ..., nums[n-1]]</code> 1次的旋转结果是<code>[nums[n-1], nums[0], nums[1], nums[2], ..., nums[n-2]</code>。</p>\n<p>输入一个旋转数组<code>nums</code>和目标值<code>target</code>。如果<code>target</code>在数组中存在，则返回索引。否则，返回<code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>限制条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\leq nums.length \\leq 5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-5000 \\leq nums[i] \\leq 5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><code>nums</code>的所有整数都是<strong>唯一的</strong></li>\n<li><code>nums</code>被排序和旋转</li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-10^4 \\leq target \\leq 10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.008548em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例子1：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], 0    \nOutput: 4\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>例子2：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], 3    \nOutput: -1\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>例子3：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [1], 0    \nOutput: -1\n</code></pre>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089e48439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 思路\n\n- 类似上一课，寻找到旋转数组的支点。\n\n- 通过支点，将数组分为对两个递增部分分别进行二分查找。","text_html":"<h2>思路</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>类似上一课，寻找到旋转数组的支点。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>通过支点，将数组分为对两个递增部分分别进行二分查找。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089eb6439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 算法\n\n> 以下为寻找旋转支点的算法，类似上一课。\n\n- $left$设为$0$，$right$设为$nums.length$。\n\n- While $left + 1 < right$:\n\n    - 以 $mid = \\frac{(left + right)}{2}$作为猜测。比较$nums[mid]$和$nums[mid - 1]$:\n\n        - If $nums[mid - 1] > nums[mid]$, \n则找到的支点，直接返回。\n\n\n        - Else if $nums[left] < nums[mid]$, 移动左边界$left = mid$。\n\n        - Else, 移动右边界$right = mid$。\n\n\n-  Return $left$.\n","text_html":"<h2>算法</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>以下为寻找旋转支点的算法，类似上一课。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>设为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">right</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>设为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums.length</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>While <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left + 1 &lt; right</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mid = \\frac{(left + right)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size5 size5 reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.345em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.22999999999999998em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped frac-line\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.485em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size5 size5 reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>作为猜测。比较<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid - 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>If <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid - 1] &gt; nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>,\n则找到的支点，直接返回。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Else if <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[left] &lt; nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>, 移动左边界<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left = mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Else, 移动右边界<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">right = mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Return <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089f06439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 编码\n\n以下是代码:","text_html":"<h2>编码</h2>\n<p>以下是代码:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089f4c439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_07089f4c439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"C++","caption":"","language":"c++","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.cpp","content":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint findPivot(vector<int>& nums) {\n  // 左索引的初始值为 0\n  int left = 0;\n  // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  int right = nums.size();\n  // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n\n    if (nums[mid - 1] > nums[mid]) {\n      // mid 是要回答的索引\n      return mid;\n    } else if (nums[left] < nums[mid]) {\n      // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n  // 左边是答案\n  return left;\n}\n\nint ascendingBinarySearch(vector<int>& nums, int left, int right, int target) {\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n\n    if (nums[mid] == target) {\n      return mid;\n    } else if (nums[mid] < target) {\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (nums[left] == target) {\n    return left;\n  }\n\n  if (right < nums.size() && nums[right] == target) {\n    return right;\n  }\n\n  return -1;\n}\n\nint search(vector<int>& nums, int target) {\n  int pivot = findPivot(nums);\n  int indexInLeftPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, 0, pivot, target);\n\n  if (indexInLeftPart != -1) {\n    return indexInLeftPart;\n  }\n\n  int indexInRightPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, pivot, nums.size(), target); \n\n  if (indexInRightPart != -1) {\n    return indexInRightPart;\n  }\n\n  return -1;\n}\n\nint main() {\n  vector<int> nums = {-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6};\n\n  cout << \"Index of 5 is ---> \"  << search(nums, 5) << endl;\n  cout << \"Index of 6 is ---> \"  << search(nums, 6) << endl;\n  cout << \"Index of -5 is ---> \"  << search(nums, -5) << endl;\n  cout << \"Index of -6 is ---> \"  << search(nums, -6) << endl;\n\n  return 0;\n}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_1_07089f4c439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"Java","caption":"旋转数组二分查找","language":"java","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.java","content":"class Solution {\n  int search(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int pivot = findPivot(nums);\n    int indexInLeftPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, 0, pivot, target);\n\n    if (indexInLeftPart != -1) {\n      return indexInLeftPart;\n    }\n\n    int indexInRightPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, pivot, nums.length, target); \n\n    if (indexInRightPart != -1) {\n      return indexInRightPart;\n    }\n\n    return -1;\n  }\n\n  int findPivot(int[] nums) {\n    // 左索引的初始值为 0\n    int left = 0;\n    // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n    int right = nums.length;\n    // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n    while (left + 1 < right) {\n      int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n\n      if (nums[mid - 1] > nums[mid]) {\n        // mid 是要回答的索引\n        return mid;\n      } else if (nums[left] < nums[mid]) {\n        // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n        left = mid;\n      } else {\n        // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n        right = mid;\n      }\n    }\n    // 左边是答案\n    return left;\n  }\n\n  int ascendingBinarySearch(int[] nums, int left, int right, int target) {\n    while (left + 1 < right) {\n      int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n\n      if (nums[mid] == target) {\n        return mid;\n      } else if (nums[mid] < target) {\n        left = mid;\n      } else {\n        right = mid;\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (nums[left] == target) {\n      return left;\n    }\n\n    if (right < nums.length && nums[right] == target) {\n      return right;\n    }\n\n    return -1;\n  }\n\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Solution sol = new Solution();\n    int[] nums = {-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6};\n\n    System.out.println(\"Index of 5 is ---> \" + sol.search(nums, 5));\n    System.out.println(\"Index of 6 is ---> \" + sol.search(nums, 6));\n    System.out.println(\"Index of -5 is ---> \" + sol.search(nums, -5));\n    System.out.println(\"Index of -6 is ---> \" + sol.search(nums, -6));\n  }\n}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_2_07089f4c439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"JavaScript","caption":"旋转数组二分查找","language":"javascript","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"index.js","content":"const search = function(nums, target) {\n  const pivot = findPivot(nums);\n  const indexInLeftPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, 0, pivot, target);\n\n  if (indexInLeftPart != -1) {\n    return indexInLeftPart;\n  }\n\n  const indexInRightPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, pivot, nums.length, target); \n\n  if (indexInRightPart != -1) {\n    return indexInRightPart;\n  }\n\n  return -1;\n}\n\nconst findPivot = function(nums) {\n  // 左索引的初始值为 0\n  let left = 0;\n  // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  let right = nums.length;\n  // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    const mid = Math.floor((right + left) / 2);\n\n    if (nums[mid - 1] > nums[mid]) {\n      // mid 是要回答的索引\n      return mid;\n    } else if (nums[left] < nums[mid]) {\n      // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n  // 左边是答案\n  return left;\n}\n\nconst ascendingBinarySearch = function(nums, left, right, target) {\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    const mid = Math.floor((right + left) / 2);\n\n    if (nums[mid] === target) {\n      return mid;\n    } else if (nums[mid] < target) {\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (nums[left] === target) {\n    return left;\n  }\n\n  if (right < nums.length && nums[right] === target) {\n    return right;\n  }\n\n  return -1;\n}\n\nconsole.log(`Index of 5 is ---> ${search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], 5)}`);\nconsole.log(`Index of 6 is ---> ${search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], 6)}`);\nconsole.log(`Index of -5 is ---> ${search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], -5)}`);\nconsole.log(`Index of -6 is ---> ${search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], -6)}`);","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_3_07089f4c439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"Python","caption":"旋转数组二分查找","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def search(nums, target):\n  pivot = findPivot(nums)\n  indexInLeftPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, 0, pivot, target)\n\n  if indexInLeftPart != -1:\n    return indexInLeftPart\n\n  indexInRightPart = ascendingBinarySearch(nums, pivot, len(nums), target)\n\n  if indexInRightPart != -1:\n    return indexInRightPart\n\n  return -1\n\ndef findPivot(nums):\n  # 左索引的初始值为 0\n  left = 0\n  # 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  right = len(nums)\n  # left + 1 >= right 时将完成while循环\n  while left + 1 < right:\n    mid = (right + left) // 2\n\n    if nums[mid - 1] > nums[mid]:\n      # mid 索引就是答案\n      return mid\n    elif nums[left] < nums[mid]:\n      # 在数组的左半部分搜索没有意义\n      left = mid\n    else:\n      # 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid\n  # 左边是答案\n  return left\n  \ndef ascendingBinarySearch(nums, left, right, target):\n  while left + 1 < right:\n    mid = (right + left) // 2\n\n    if nums[mid] == target:\n      return mid\n    elif nums[mid] < target:\n      left = mid\n    else:\n      right = mid\n\n  if nums[left] == target:\n    return left\n\n  if right < len(nums) and nums[right] == target:\n    return right\n\n  return -1\n\ndef main():\n  print(\"Index of 5 is ---> \" + str(search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], 5)))\n  print(\"Index of 6 is ---> \" + str(search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], 6)))\n  print(\"Index of -5 is ---> \" + str(search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], -5)))\n  print(\"Index of -6 is ---> \" + str(search([-5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, -8, -7, -6], -6)))\n\nmain()","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089f88439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 复杂度\n\n- **时间复杂度**:$O(log_2\\space n)$\n- **空间复杂度**: $O(1)$","text_html":"<h2>复杂度</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>:<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2\\space n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"07089fce439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"---\n\n在下一课中尝试在旋转数组中统计出现次数。","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>在下一课中尝试在旋转数组中统计出现次数。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6}],"status":"undo","course_no":"006","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/006/page/270"}
